  <item>
    <title>03.2024年百广非商安利</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67c1ec1fbf52a16cd1b7244f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67c1ec1fbf52a16cd1b7244f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 01 Mar 2025 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期播客是2月13日B站直播录制，上麦的嘉宾有麋鹿老师、闲来老师和tako老师。</span></p><p><span>主要内容:结合之前我在微博、B站收集的问卷对2024年有更新的非商做个小安利，部分剧会放一小段cut。</span></p><p><span>需要说明的是，本期的每个剧都仅做简单介绍，并非剧评，大家有感兴趣的剧可以去各平台听一下。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="31">00:31</a>刺客桃不换</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="265">04:25</a>秋水长天乱红颜</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="459">07:39</a>空船</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="973">16:13</a>象牙塔没有秋天 左面的皮克斯</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1172">19:32</a>沪城雪</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1502">25:02</a>当那天财神住到我家后 我家有只可爱鬼</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1615">26:55</a>叛逆白月光</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1811">30:11</a>谋杀夏日</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1976">32:56</a>暗恋日记</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2052">34:12</a>摘朵月亮给你</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2187">36:27</a>意难平</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2238">37:18</a>再次为了这颗星</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2322">38:42</a>逆爱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2478">41:18</a>脱敏期</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2610">43:30</a>荒岛七年</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2780">46:20</a>十日连丧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2861">47:41</a>佟养媳 佟养溪</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2926">48:46</a>我从地府请假出来做后期的那些事儿</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2955">49:15</a> 闲聊</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6742a6fff09dd524ee319181/lsP0ce5dAD6SFTyJ1zedW6YwWhyn.m4a" length="53736019" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:55:22</itunes:duration>
